  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> divide shoulder circumference by hip circumference. The average is about <strong>1.18 for men</strong> and <strong>1.03 for women</strong>. For women, above 1.05 suggests an inverted triangle and below 0.96 a pear shape.</p></div>

